          <h1>Below the surface</h1>
          <p>Friday night. Priya, 31, is out for dinner with friends. She was diagnosed with type 1 diabetes at 24. Nothing at this table would tell you.</p>
          <p class="hint">Scroll to go under <svg width="14" height="18" viewBox="0 0 14 18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v15M1.5 10.5 7 16l5.5-5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></p>
