<div class="wrap">
  <section class="after">
    <h2>What helps</h2>
    <p class="lede">You don't need to understand the maths. A few small things make life easier for someone with type 1.</p>
    <ul class="helps">
      <li><h3>Let them get on with it</h3><p>Checking a phone, pressing buttons on a pump or taking insulin at the table is ordinary. No need to look away or make it a moment.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Skip the food commentary</h3><p>“Should you be eating that?” never helps. They've already done the sums, probably twice.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Know what a low looks like</h3><p>If they seem shaky, sweaty or confused, offer juice and stay with them. <a href="low-helper.html">Open the Low helper</a> for what to do.</p></li>
    </ul>
